  "title": {
    "bn": "প্রতিদিন সকালে",
    "tr": "protidin shokale",
    "en": "Every morning"
  },
  "summary": "Morning at home: everyone is busy, and Rafi is 'studying'.",
  "status": "draft",
  "lines": [
    {
      "bn": "নানি প্রতিদিন খুব সকালে ওঠেন।",
      "tr": "nani protidin khub shokale othen.",
      "en": "Nani gets up very early every day."
    },
    {
      "bn": "তারপর উনি নামাজ পড়েন।",
      "tr": "tarpor uni namaj poren.",
      "en": "Then she prays."
    },
    {
      "bn": "আব্বু সাতটায় ওঠেন আর আটটায় অফিসে যান।",
      "tr": "abbu shattay othen ar attay ofise jan.",
      "en": "Abbu gets up at seven and goes to the office at eight."
    },
    {
      "bn": "নাদিয়া ডাক্তার। ও প্রতিদিন অনেক কাজ করে।",
      "tr": "nadiya daktar. o protidin onek kaj kore.",
      "en": "Nadia is a doctor. She works a lot every day."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ammu",
      "bn": "রাফি, তুমি কী করছো?",
      "tr": "rafi, tumi ki korchho?",
      "en": "Rafi, what are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Rafi",
      "bn": "আমি পড়ছি, আম্মু!",
      "tr": "ami porchhi, ammu!",
      "en": "I'm studying, Mom!"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ammu",
      "bn": "সত্যি? তাহলে বই কোথায়?",
      "tr": "shotti? tahole boi kothay?",
      "en": "Really? Then where's your book?"
    },
    {
      "bn": "আসলে রাফি টিভি দেখছে।",
      "tr": "ashole rafi tibhi dekhchhe.",
      "en": "Actually, Rafi is watching TV."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ammu",
      "bn": "রাফি! টিভি না, বই!",
      "tr": "rafi! tibhi na, boi!",
      "en": "Rafi! Not the TV, your book!"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Rafi",
      "bn": "আচ্ছা, আম্মু। এখন পড়ছি।",
      "tr": "achchha, ammu. ekhon porchhi.",
      "en": "OK, Mom. I'm studying now."
    }
  ],
